    ('ios_physical_smoke', 'iOS physical smoke', 'blocked', 'Historical product commit 9c2dce4200dbba5487c8c458ade4616005fde6e6 retains simulator-only Apple 1.1.0 (6) app/widget/watch and localized creative evidence, but it does not transfer to current authority 2cdd4387fc2b8b0f4cd3e3a873f019a6ca8a3652. Twelve targeted current-source iOS Simulator provider tests pass. Exact-source hosted run 33300967788 at evidence head fb877d30b2179a489f5ce18dd06d892461436540 passed its 23m59s iOS job, including shared Simulator tests, 18/18 Apple surface-state tests, and the unsigned application build. There is no retained, accepted, byte-verified source-current distribution-signed archive or IPA, iOS 15 runtime pass, or physical iPhone/iPad/widget/paired-watch result. The gate remains blocked.', 'Create and verify distribution-signed build 6, re-establish CoreDevice readiness, then run the exact artifact on iPhone, iPad, widget, and paired watch paths'),
